    {
      "source": "Also <a href=\"#unregisterNamedDispatcher(java.lang.String)\"><code>unregisters</code></a> the current default\n<code>RequestDispatcher</code> and <a href=\"#registerNamedDispatcher(java.lang.String,jakarta.servlet.RequestDispatcher)\"><code>replaces</code></a>\nit with a <a href=\"MockRequestDispatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.web\"><code>MockRequestDispatcher</code></a> for the provided\n<code>defaultServletName</code>.",
      "translation": "同时<a href=\"#unregisterNamedDispatcher(java.lang.String)\"><code>unregisters</code></a>当前的默认<code>RequestDispatcher</code>，并用提供的<code>defaultServletName</code>的<a href=\"MockRequestDispatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.web\"><code>MockRequestDispatcher</code></a><a href=\"#registerNamedDispatcher(java.lang.String,jakarta.servlet.RequestDispatcher)\"><code>replaces</code></a>它。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For setting up a full <code>WebApplicationContext</code> in a test environment, you can\nuse <code>AnnotationConfigWebApplicationContext</code>, <code>XmlWebApplicationContext</code>,\nor <code>GenericWebApplicationContext</code>, passing in a corresponding\n<code>MockServletContext</code> instance. Consider configuring your\n<code>MockServletContext</code> with a <code>FileSystemResourceLoader</code> in order to\ninterpret resource paths as relative filesystem locations.",
      "translation": "要在测试环境中设置完整的 `<code>WebApplicationContext</code>`，您可以使用 `<code>AnnotationConfigWebApplicationContext</code>`、`<code>XmlWebApplicationContext</code>` 或 `<code>GenericWebApplicationContext</code>`，并传入相应的 `<code>MockServletContext</code>` 实例。建议配置您的 `<code>MockServletContext</code>` 以包含一个 `<code>FileSystemResourceLoader</code>`，从而将资源路径解释为相对文件系统位置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Compatible with Servlet 6.1 but can be configured to expose a specific version\nthrough <a href=\"#setMajorVersion(int)\"><code>setMajorVersion(int)</code></a>/<a href=\"#setMinorVersion(int)\"><code>setMinorVersion(int)</code></a>; default is 6.1.\nNote that some Servlet SPI support is limited: servlet, filter and listener\nregistration methods are not supported; neither is JSP configuration.\nWe generally do not recommend to unit test your ServletContainerInitializers and\nWebApplicationInitializers which is where those registration methods would be used.",
      "translation": "与 Servlet 6.1 兼容，但可通过 `<a href=\"#setMajorVersion(int)\"><code>setMajorVersion(int)</code></a>` / `<a href=\"#setMinorVersion(int)\"><code>setMinorVersion(int)</code></a>` 配置为暴露特定版本；默认值为 6.1。\n请注意，某些 Servlet SPI 支持有限：不支持 servlet、filter 和 listener 的注册方法；也不支持 JSP 配置。\n我们通常不建议对 `ServletContainerInitializers` 和 `WebApplicationInitializers` 进行单元测试，因为这些是上述注册方法的使用位置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
